    "text": "Let <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math> . For any <math><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8838;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>,</mo></math> define <math><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>{</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>}</mo></math> . If <math><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>]</mo></math> , then which one of the following statements is not true?",
